function [t, disp] = couple_axis(tau, sigma, disp)
%COUPLE_AXIS  The couple's torque tau turned by its misalignment (sigma [rad]), drawn from disp.
%   tau: real[N m][3] (passed in m^2 kg/s^2)
%   sigma: real[1] (passed a plain number)
